161</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tworek</surname><given-names>BL</given-names></name><name><surname>Tuma</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Casey</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Decreased binding of asialoglycoproteins to hepatocytes from ethanol-fed rats</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>1996</year><volume>271</volume><fpage>2531</fpage><lpage>2538</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8576217</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1074/jbc.271.5.2531</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tworek</surname><given-names>BL</given-names></name><name><surname>Wiegert</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Jeanette</surname><given-names>JP</given-names><suffix>2nd</suffix></name><name><surname>Tuma</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Casey</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Differential effects of monensin on asialoglycoprotein receptor function after short-term ethanol administration</article-title><source>Biochem Pharmacol</source><year>1998</year><volume>55</volume><fpage>1603</fpage><lpage>1609</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9633996</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0006-2952(98)00005-7</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tworek</surname><given-names>BL</given-names></name><name><surname>Wiegert</surname><given-names>RL</given-names></name><name><surname>Tuma</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Casey</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effects of monensin on ethanol-induced alterations in function of hepatocellular asialoglycoprotein receptor subpopulations</